<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIA AND BRAZIL DRAW 2-2 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIA AND BRAZIL DRAW 2-2 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia and Brazil drew 2-2</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Russia - Yuri Nikiforov (18th minute), Vladislav Rodimov</p>
<p>(80th)</p>
<p>Brazil - Donizetti (47th), Ronaldo (85th)</p>
<p>Attendence: 20,000</p>
